ć koszt transportu oraz dźwigu do miejsca montażu. W cenę nie jest wliczony projekt architektoniczno-budowlany.","question":"Czy cena zawiera transport, dźwig i projekt budowlany?"},{"id":"lord-plus-faq-2","answer":"Tak, wszystkie ceny z oferty producenta są cenami netto. Stawka VAT zależy od przeznaczenia budynku.","question":"Czy podane ceny są cenami netto?"},{"id":"lord-plus-faq-3","answer":"Producent udziela gwarancji na 24 miesiące na całość domu oraz na 10 lat na konstrukcję.","question":"Jaka jest gwarancja?"},{"id":"lord-plus-faq-4","answer":"W technologii producenta nie ma potrzeby wykańczania ścian, podłóg ani sufitów. Wygłuszenie stropu jest dostępne jako opcja.","question":"Czy po montażu trzeba wykańczać wnętrza?"},{"id":"lord-plus-faq-5","answer":"Tak, za dopłatą. Producent podaje jej wysokość w indywidualnej wycenie.","question":"Czy ramy okienne mogą mieć inny kolor?"},{"id":"lord-plus-faq-6","answer":"Zakres prac obejmuje montaż domu, montaż stóp fundamentowych, wykonanie izolacji termicznej ścian zewnętrznych, podłogi i dachu, położenie blachodachówki, orynnowanie, montaż stolarki okiennej i drzwi zewnętrznych, rozprowadzenie instalacji elektrycznej i wodno-kanalizacyjnej oraz wykonanie elewacji.","question":"Co obejmuje zakres prac producenta?"}]'::jsonb, NULL, '[{"id":"lord-plus-req-1","key":"dojazd-dla-transportu","label":"Dojazd dla transportu","custom":false},{"id":"lord-plus-req-2","key":"formalnosci","label":"Formalności","custom":false},{"id":"lord-plus-req-3","key":null,"label":"Impregnacja zewnętrzna budynku we własnym zakresie lub zlecona firmie","custom":true}]'::jsonb, NULL, 'logbar-lord-plus') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO "product_translation" ("id", "product_id", "locale", "name", "description", "created_at", "updated_at", "room_layout", "faq", "ai_generated_name", "ai_generated_description", "ai_translated_from_name", "ai_translated_from_description", "client_requirements", "foundation_options", "technical_specs", "construction_system", "roof_type", "customization_scope", "service_scope_description") VALUES ('424b7084-0114-4c2f-8985-52c1752a39c3', '234243b6-4876-5fdd-a263-45c0d478f6fc', 'en', 'Logbar Monako 111 A', 'A modern house with a footprint of 82.89 m² (11.68 × 7.1 m) and large glazed gables. A ground floor of 55.38 m² with a living room with kitchenette, two rooms and a bathroom, and an upper floor of 32.37 m² with two rooms and a bathroom, together about 88 m² of usable floor area (111 m² measured at floor level). Gable roof at 40°, with a 12.63 m² covered terrace within the building volume. Façade A: light profiled cladding boards with elements of Shou Sugi Ban charred wood. A 38.90 m² uncovered terrace is available as an option.', '2026-10-09T06:28:14.071Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-09T07:04:52.656Z'::timestamptz, '[{"id":"monako-111-a-room-1","name":"Hallway"},{"id":"monako-111-a-room-2","name":"Room"},{"id":"monako-111-a-room-3","name":"Room"},{"id":"monako-111-a-room-4","name":"Bathroom"},{"id":"monako-111-a-room-5","name":"Living room with kitchenette"},{"id":"monako-111-a-room-6","name":"Hallway"},{"id":"monako-111-a-room-7","name":"Room"},{"id":"monako-111-a-room-8","name":"Bathroom"},{"id":"monako-111-a-room-9","name":"Room"}]'::jsonb, '[{"id":"monako-111-a-faq-1","answer":"No. The cost of transport and of a crane at the assembly site must be added to the price. The architectural and building design is not included.","question":"Does the price include transport, a crane and the building design?"},{"id":"monako-111-a-faq-2","answer":"Yes, all prices in the producer''s offer are net prices. The VAT rate depends on the intended use of the building.","question":"Are the prices net prices?"},{"id":"monako-111-a-faq-3","answer":"The producer gives a 24-month warranty on the whole house and a 10-year warranty on the structure.","question":"What is the warranty?"},{"id":"monako-111-a-faq-4","answer":"In the finished-interior standard the walls and ceiling are finished with tongue-and-groove boards or plasterboard and the floor has a dry screed, so they need no further finishing. In the closed-shell state (SSZ) this work is not included in the price.","question":"Do the interiors need finishing after assembly?"},{"id":"monako-111-a-faq-5","answer":"Yes, for a surcharge. The producer states its amount in an individual quotation.","question":"Can the window frames have a different colour?"},{"id":"monako-111-a-faq-6","answer":"The scope of work includes assembling the house, installing the foundation pads, insulating the external walls, floor and roof, laying standing-seam roof panels or metal roof tiles, guttering, installing the windows and external doors, running the electrical and water and sewage installations, and finishing the façade.","question":"What does the producer''s scope of work cover?"}]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, 'Foundation pads are included in the price (floor on a point foundation, U = 0.184 W/(m²·K)). A fully insulated foundation slab (U = 0.180 W/(m²·K)) or a slab with a concrete floor provided by the investor is optional.', NULL, 'Timber frame of C24 structural timber (45 × 145 mm studs), walls insulated with 150 + 50 mm mineral wool, roof 200 + 50 mm', 'Gable roof, 40° pitch, ridge height 6.72 m; covering: standing-seam panels or metal roof tiles', 'Surcharges for an uncovered terrace, priming and painting of the façade, winder stairs and a fully insulated foundation slab with pads under the bay. Surcharge for window frames in a different colour.', 'The scope of work includes assembling the house, installing the foundation pads, insulating the external walls, floor and roof, laying standing-seam roof panels or metal roof tiles, guttering, installing the windows and external doors, running the electrical and water and sewage installations, and finishing the façade.') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO "product_translation" ("id", "product_id", "locale", "name", "description", "created_at", "updated_at", "room_layout", "faq", "ai_generated_name", "ai_generated_description", "ai_translated_from_name", "ai_translated_from_description", "client_requirements", "foundation_options", "technical_specs", "construction_system", "roof_type", "customization_scope", "service_scope_description") VALUES ('083dd516-c6de-49ab-9851-64dc3d891a70', '234243b6-4876-5fdd-a263-45c0d478f6fc', 'de', 'Logbar Monako 111 A', 'Modernes Haus mit 82,89 m² Grundfläche (11,68 × 7,1 m) und großen Verglasungen im Giebel. Erdgeschoss mit 55,38 m²: Wohnzimmer mit Küchenzeile, zwei Zimmer und Bad; Obergeschoss mit 32,37 m²: zwei Zimmer und Bad; zusammen rund 88 m² Nutzfläche (111 m² Bodenfläche). Satteldach mit 40° Neigung und eine überdachte Terrasse von 12,63 m² im Baukörper. Fassade A: helle profilierte Fassadenbretter mit Elementen aus nach Shou-Sugi-Ban-Art verkohltem Holz. Eine unüberdachte Terrasse mit 38,90 m² ist als Option erhältlich.', '2026-10-09T06:28:14.071Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-09T07:04:52.656Z'::timestamptz, '[{"id":"monako-111-a-room-1","name":"Flur"},{"id":"monako-111-a-room-2","name":"Zimmer"},{"id":"monako-111-a-room-3","name":"Zimmer"},{"id":"monako-111-a-room-4","name":"Badezimmer"},{"id":"monako-111-a-room-5","name":"Wohnzimmer mit Küchenzeile"},{"id":"monako-111-a-room-6","name":"Flur"},{"id":"monako-111-a-room-7","name":"Zimmer"},{"id":"monako-111-a-room-8","name":"Badezimmer"},{"id":"monako-111-a-room-9","name":"Zimmer"}]'::jsonb, '[{"id":"monako-111-a-faq-1","answer":"Nein. Zum Preis kommen die Kosten für den Transport und für einen Kran am Montageort hinzu. Die Architektur- und Bauplanung ist nicht im Preis enthalten.","question":"Sind Transport, Kran und Bauplanung im Preis enthalten?"},{"id":"monako-111-a-faq-2","answer":"Ja, alle Preise im Angebot des Herstellers sind Nettopreise. Der Mehrwertsteuersatz hängt von der Nutzung des Gebäudes ab.","question":"Sind die angegebenen Preise Nettopreise?"},{"id":"monako-111-a-faq-3","answer":"Der Hersteller gibt 24 Monate Garantie auf das gesamte Haus und 10 Jahre auf die Konstruktion.","question":"Welche Garantie gibt es?"},{"id":"monako-111-a-faq-4","answer":"Beim Standard mit Innenausbau sind Wände und Decke mit Profilholz oder Gipskartonplatten verkleidet und der Boden hat einen Trockenestrich, sodass kein weiterer Ausbau nötig ist. Beim Rohbau geschlossen (SSZ) sind diese Arbeiten nicht im Preis enthalten.","question":"Muss der Innenraum nach der Montage noch ausgebaut werden?"},{"id":"monako-111-a-faq-5","answer":"Ja, gegen Aufpreis. Die Höhe nennt der Hersteller im individuellen Angebot.","question":"Können die Fensterrahmen eine andere Farbe haben?"},{"id":"monako-111-a-faq-6","answer":"Der Leistungsumfang umfasst die Montage des Hauses, die Montage der Punktfundamente, die Wärmedämmung von Außenwänden, Boden und Dach, die Dachdeckung mit Stehfalzpaneelen oder Blechdachziegeln, die Dachrinnen, den Einbau von Fenstern und Außentüren, die Elektro- und die Wasser-/Abwasserinstallation sowie die Ausführung der Fassade.","question":"Was umfasst der Leistungsumfang des Herstellers?"}]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, 'Punktfundamente sind im Preis enthalten (Boden auf Punktfundament, U = 0,184 W/(m²·K)). Optional ist eine voll gedämmte Fundamentplatte (U = 0,180 W/(m²·K)) oder eine Platte mit Betonboden durch den Bauherrn.', NULL, 'Holzrahmen aus Konstruktionsholz der Klasse C24 (Ständer 45 × 145 mm), Wände mit 150 + 50 mm Mineralwolle gedämmt, Dach 200 + 50 mm', 'Satteldach, 40° Neigung, Firsthöhe 6,72 m; Deckung: Stehfalzpaneele oder Blechdachziegel', 'Aufpreise für eine unüberdachte Terrasse, Grundierung und Anstrich der Fassade, gewendelte Treppe sowie eine voll gedämmte Fundamentplatte mit Punktfundamenten unter dem Erker. Aufpreis für Fensterrahmen in einer anderen Farbe.', 'Der Leistungsumfang umfasst die Montage des Hauses, die Montage der Punktfundamente, die Wärmedämmung von Außenwänden, Boden und Dach, die Dachdeckung mit Stehfalzpaneelen oder Blechdachziegeln, die Dachrinnen, den Einbau von Fenstern und Außentüren, die Elektro- und die Wasser-/Abwasserinstallation sowie die Ausführung der Fassade.') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO "product_translation" ("id", "product_id", "locale", "name", "description", "created_at", "updated_at", "room_layout", "faq", "ai_generated_name", "ai_generated_description", "ai_translated_from_name", "ai_translated_from_description", "client_requirements", "foundation_options", "technical_specs", "construction_system", "roof_type", "customization_scope", "service_scope_description") VALUES ('ca6fd820-33cb-4ba6-89d6-fb4f589b3606', 'f29ca9a4-5ac5-54b0-8d28-7ba37c6e5de6', 'en', 'Logbar Finezja', 'A 5 × 7 m house with a covered patio that meets residential building requirements. Gable roof at 35°, trapezoid windows and a façade of light boards or boards charred with the Japanese Shou Sugi Ban method. Downstairs a living room, kitchen, hall and bathroom, upstairs two rooms and a hallway, together about 50 m² (57.3 m² measured at floor level) of usable floor area. A 34.77 m² patio is available as an option.', '2026-10-09T06:28:15.182Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-09T07:04:53.591Z'::timestamptz, '[{"id":"finezja-room-1","name":"Entrance vestibule"},{"id":"finezja-room-2","name":"Kitchen"},{"id":"finezja-room-3","name":"Bathroom"},{"id":"finezja-room-4","name":"Living room"},{"id":"finezja-room-5","name":"Room"},{"id":"finezja-room-6","name":"Room"},{"id":"finezja-room-7","name":"Hallway"}]'::jsonb, '[{"id":"finezja-faq-1","answer":"No. The cost of transport and of a crane at the assembly site must be added to the price. The architectural and building design is not included.","question":"Does the price include transport, a crane and the building design?"},{"id":"finezja-faq-2","answer":"Yes, all prices in the producer''s offer are net prices. The VAT rate depends on the intended use of the building.","question":"Are the prices net prices?"},{"id":"finezja-faq-3","answer":"The producer gives a 24-month warranty on the whole house and a 10-year warranty on the structure.","question":"What is the warranty?"},{"id":"finezja-faq-4","answer":"In the producer''s technology there is no need to finish the walls, floors or ceilings. Sound-deadening of the ceiling is available as an option.","question":"Do the interiors need finishing after assembly?"},{"id":"finezja-faq-5","answer":"Yes, for a surcharge. The producer states its amount in an individual quotation.","question":"Can the window frames have a different colour?"},{"id":"finezja-faq-6","answer":"The scope of work includes assembling the house, installing the foundation pads, insulating the external walls, floor and roof, laying standing-seam roof panels, installing the windows and external doors, running the electrical and water and sewage installations, and finishing the façade.","question":"What does the producer''s scope of work cover?"}]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{"id":"finezja-req-3","label":"External impregnation of the building, done by the investor or commissioned from a company"}]'::jsonb, 'Foundation pads are included in the price. An uninsulated or a fully insulated foundation slab is optional.', NULL, 'Timber frame of C24 structural timber (42 × 135 mm joists, 42 × 150 mm battens), walls insulated with 150 mm mineral wool, roof 200 mm', 'Gable roof, 35° pitch, ridge height 6.33 m; covering: standing-seam panels', 'Surcharges for the patio, boards charred with the Shou Sugi Ban method, priming and painting of the façade, sound-deadening of the ceiling, winder stairs, an uninsulated or fully insulated foundation slab and anti-rodent mesh. Surcharge for window frames in a different colour.', 'The scope of work includes assembling the house, installing the foundation pads, insulating the external walls, floor and roof, laying standing-seam roof panels, installing the windows and external doors, running the electrical and water and sewage installations, and finishing the façade.') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
